description:
Sales workflows for Notion, Gmail, Dropbox and CRM, with operator review and traceable task records.

Enable/select the plugin, then use:
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow init - Choose Chinese or English; set up operator, accounts and the Aimore workspace.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow add-communication <content or message URL> - Prepare manual CRM Notes for review.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow start - Start the native 15-minute approved-work task.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow stop - Delete this installation's scan task.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow run-auto - Run one mailbox and automatic-task scan; no customer sends or schedule activation.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow report - Update and show the daily action report; no notifications or Calendar changes.
@eightdegrees-sales-workflow reply-draft <inquiry URL> - Prepare a reply and HTML preview; stop at send approval.

Open Aimore/Today for current tasks. Review short summaries and full same-version material; saved input requests are checked by the appropriate workflow.

